                                "sense_id": "34145fd9-5c82-3df4-9b7b-07d903235536",
                                "text": "This mornin’ she rails out at me fer dunkin’ my cooky and she says COFFEE IS FER SIPPIN’ AND NOT FER SAUCERIN’ . . ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "894eadc1-c640-47a5-9a5c-24cb80a5cd8d",
                                "sense_id": "34145fd9-5c82-3df4-9b7b-07d903235536",
                                "text": "‘Got summat fer yeh here – I mighta sat on it at some point, but it’ll taste all right.’"
                            }
                        ]
